  "notes": [
    "Haarlemmerweg 285-303 (pand 0363100012097137, built 1996), the GWL-terrein's L-shaped west corner block: a nine-storey arm on the Haarlemmerweg facing the Westerpark and an eight-storey wing running south-south-west; 25.6 m.",
    "walls[0] the Haarlemmerweg front (panel 74 and the corner panels 16, 15, 54, 78; crops w03-354L 2021-03-24 and w03-354 2025-09-29, square on): red-brown brick like the long block next door (Haarlemmerweg 217-283, the same measured #845448), white-framed windows about 0.7 x 1.45 m with one wide two-light window per row (windowPattern), no stone sills, a low dark-brick ground storey with front doors up a stair (stoneStoreys 0 in the dark brick), and a blind parapet storey over the top window row (blankStoreys 8, storeyFactors).",
    "walls[1] the corner panel 6 (crop w06-360L 2020-01-27): nine storeys, six windows a row above, four on the lower three storeys, doors on the ground.",
    "walls[2] the west wing front (panels 14 and 11, crop w01-292L 2021-03-22): the same brick and windows on a 1.2 m pitch with wide windows every few bays, a dark brick ground storey of front doors behind steps, and a stack of recessed timber-fronted loggias at the north end of the top three storeys (loggias).",
    "walls[3] the courtyard side (panel 67, crop w02-112L 2019-11-08, behind trees).",
    "NOT DRAWN (kit cannot say): the upper four storeys of the Haarlemmerweg arm cantilever about 0.5 m over the lower three (one 3DBAG plane); the mid-wing loggia stack on storeys 1-4 (one loggias set per group).",
    "Measured 2026-10-25 (measure.ts, evidence in measured.json): groups 0, 1, 2 take the photo's wall and glass colour, window shape, bay count and front class; walls[0] glass #7b5550 not used (not darker than the wall #855449 by 10 L*, or tinted): kit glass kept; walls[0] bays 3 from the likeness grid (padded measurement 11); walls[1] glass #4e342c not used (not darker than the wall #55362e by 10 L*, or tinted): kit glass kept; walls[2] glass #403431 not used (not darker than the wall #4d3431 by 10 L*, or tinted): kit glass kept.",
    "Lit colour (2026-10-25 integrator review): the front faces north and its crops are shade readings, so the colours are left unmeasured and the export brightens them like any shaded wall."
  ],
